# MCP On-Demand

- Default workflows use native tools: Read, Grep, Glob, Edit, Write, Shell, Task.
- Do not call MCP tools unless the user explicitly requests them or names a specific MCP/integration in the prompt.
- Do not install or assume claude-flow, AgentDB, or other Ruflo MCP infrastructure.
- Learning and memory use LEARNINGS.md and local scripts — not MCP memory tools.
